{{ define "content" }}
    <div class="space-y-6">
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
            Organization administration is the boundary for members, tokens, email, and backups in the hosted product.
            Those controls are not wired in v1.0.0 yet; this page is the placeholder so later versions can land here without changing the navbar.
        </p>

        <dl class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-4">
                <dt class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-900">Instance</dt>
                <dd class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-600">SQLite at the configured data directory. Default login is the seeded <span translate="no">admin</span> user.</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-4">
                <dt class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-900">Available now</dt>
                <dd class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-600">Applications, setup guide, releases, builds, and the public portal stub.</dd>
            </div>
        </dl>

        <div class="rounded-lg border border-dashed border-gray-300 bg-gray-50 px-6 py-8">
            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-900">Coming in a later version</p>
            <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm text-gray-600">
                <li>Organization profile, branding, and custom domains</li>
                <li>Outgoing email and background jobs</li>
                <li>API tokens, backups, and store connections (Google Play, App Store Connect)</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
{{ end }}
